# <%= current_page.data.title %>

You'll find runbooks here on managing resource requests, like environments with GPU access or an increase to Justice AI Gateway allowances.

## Increase AI usage limits for a project

The approved increase should be applied by an AI Gateway administrator with the required permissions:

1. Identify the project ID in/from the request from the user.
1. Log in to https://admin.ai-gateway.justice.gov.uk/.
1. Navigate to Teams.
1. Select the Team ID corresponding to the project ID.
1. Go to Settings > Edit Settings.
1. Update Max Budget (USD) to the approved value.
1. Save the change.
1. Confirm the outcome with the requester in the original Slack thread.
